      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/100000001102.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">１．</span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai15_rb_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"5107717\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>この カタログを もらっても いいですか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Tôi lấy ca-ta-lô này có được không?</span><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>…ええ、いいですよ。 どうぞ。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Vâng, được ạ. Xin mời.</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2． </span> </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai15_rb_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"5107718\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>この <ruby>辞書<rp>(</rp><rt>じしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>借<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りても いいですか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Tôi mượn quyển từ điển này có được không?</span><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>…すみません、ちょっと。。。。<ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> <ruby>使<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って います。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Xin lỗi, không được rồi… Bây giờ tôi đang dùng<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span>.</span></div></div></div><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3．</span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai15_rb_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"5107719\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>ここで <ruby>遊<rp>(</rp><rt>あそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでは いけません。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Không được chơi ở đây.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>…はい。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">…Vâng.</div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4．</span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai15_rb_4.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"5107720\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>市役所<rp>(</rp><rt>しやくしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>番号<rp>(</rp><rt>ばんごう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って いますか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Anh/chị có biết số điện thoại của Văn phòng hành chính quận (thành phố) không?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>…いいえ、<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りません。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Không, tôi không biết.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">5． </span> </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai15_rb_5.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"5107721\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>マリアさんは どこに <ruby>住<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んで いますか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Chị Maria sống ở đâu?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… <ruby>大阪<rp>(</rp><rt>おおさか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>住<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んで います。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Tôi ở Osaka.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">6．</span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai15_rb_6.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"5107722\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>ワンさんは <ruby>独身<rp>(</rp><rt>どくしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Anh Wang còn độc thân à?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… いいえ、<ruby>結婚<rp>(</rp><rt>けっこん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して います。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Không, tôi đã lập gia đình.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">7．</span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai15_rb_7.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"5107723\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>お<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は <ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Anh/chị làm nghề gì?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… <ruby>教師<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。 <ruby>高校<rp>(</rp><rt>こうこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で <ruby>教<rp>(</rp><rt>おし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えて います。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Tôi làm giáo viên. Tôi dạy ở trường THPT.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p></div>",
